OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,FAn apple farmer in Sittingbourne in
OL,7,FKent says he's losing 100,000 litres
OL,8,Fof water a day due to a leak in his
OL,9,Forchard caused by a split pipe.
OL,11,FNick Swatland says the leak has been
OL,12,Fgoing on for around six months and
OL,13,Fit's leaking the equivalent of a
OL,14,Fmedium-sized swimming pool every day.
OL,16,FMr Swatland says South East Water
OL,17,Fhasn't been able to complete the
OL,18,Frepair - due to complications caused
OL,19,Fby the heatwave.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
