OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian he said: "The
OL,7,Fground is very wet.
OL,9,F"The tractors, even with four-wheel
OL,10,Fdrive, have a job to traverse the
OL,11,Fterritory.
OL,13,F"It's not good for the trees - they do
OL,14,Fneed water, but this is leaking out at
OL,15,Fa rate of around about 100,000 litres
OL,16,Fa day.
OL,18,F"Nothing seems to be done about it.
OL,20,F"It has to stop sooner, and the sooner
OL,21,Fthe better."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,FIn Whitstable, one campaigner says
OL,7,Fvast amounts of water is being wasted.
OL,9,FElane Heffernan from SOS Whitstable
OL,10,Fsaid: "We see water flowing in the
OL,11,Fstreets sometimes.
OL,13,F"They don't come to fix it for days -
OL,14,Fand we get all these messages telling
OL,15,Fus not to use water.
OL,17,F"It's unbelievable really."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for
OL,7,FSouth East Water said: "We're aware of
OL,8,Fthis ongoing issue and understand Mr.
OL,9,FSwatland's frustration. We never want
OL,10,Fto see water lost to leaks and we are
OL,11,Fvery sorry for the disruption this has
OL,12,Fcaused to his farm over the past
OL,13,Fmonths.
OL,15,F"We have undertaken investigations and
OL,16,Fcompleting a successful repair is
OL,17,Fhighly complex in this specific
OL,18,Flocation as the leak is on a key
OL,19,Fpipeline which supplies the wider area.
OL,26,@oD@XOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,F"The complexity of this leak means
OL,7,Fthat we are unable to implement a fix
OL,8,Fquickly due to the risk of impacting
OL,9,Fthe supply to the wider area.
OL,11,F"We are aware of leaks raised in
OL,12,FWhitstable and are arranging a meeting
OL,13,Fwith the campaigner, SOS Whitstable,
OL,14,Fto discuss them and outline our
OL,15,Fresponse.
OL,17,F"We spend around #63 million a year on
OL,18,Ffinding and fixing leaks across the
OL,19,Fnetwork and are committed to investing
OL,20,Ffurther to reduce the amount of water
OL,21,Flost to leaks by half by 2050.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,F"In the last year, we have found and
OL,7,Ffixed over 21,000 leaks on our
OL,8,Fnetwork, and a further 6,000 customer-
OL,9,Fside leaks. This is around a 10 per
OL,10,Fcent increase on the previous year.
OL,12,F"We have more staff than ever finding
OL,13,Fand fixing leaks. In total, we have
OL,14,F400 people working on repairing leaks
OL,15,Fwhen they are reported, with a further
OL,16,F116 technicians searching for and
OL,17,Ffinding leaks proactively.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
