OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786281506
OL,3,CApple orchard losing 100,000 litres of
OL,4,Cwater a day due to leaking split pipe
OL,6,F"We'd like to thank everyone who takes
OL,7,Fthe time to report leaks to us - it
OL,8,Freally does help us to find and fix
OL,9,Fproblems on our network.
OL,11,F"If anyone spots a leak, it can be
OL,12,Freported to us through our online
OL,13,FAquAlerter platform:
OL,14,Fsoutheastwater.co.uk".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@UO]
